@startuml
' Diagram author: Eethanzyj.
' Depicted storage persistence implementation: WillChin484848 (PR #42).
' Original capacity feature: Kaishhhh.
title Capacity restoration: pending storage integration (PR #42)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
hide footbox

participant ":Duke" as Duke
participant "storage:Storage" as Storage
participant "orders:OrderList" as Orders

note over Duke, Orders
  Successful startup with an existing, valid save file.
  This flow describes PR #42, not the current master.
end note
activate Duke
Duke -> Storage : load()
activate Storage
create Orders
Storage -> Orders : new OrderList()
activate Orders
deactivate Orders
note over Storage, Orders
  The initial capacity is 5.
  Storage reads and validates the saved lines.
end note
opt file contains # dailyCapacity=3
  Storage -> Orders : setDailyCapacity(3)
  activate Orders
  deactivate Orders
end
ref over Storage, Orders : Restore records and their IDs.
Storage --> Duke : orders
deactivate Storage
note over Duke, Storage
  Invalid or unreadable data throws IllegalStateException.
  Duke reports the error and stops before the CLI runs.
end note
deactivate Duke
@enduml
